{"product_id":"adalya-ad40000-40000-puffs","title":"Adalya AD40000 (40000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Adalya Aurora 40K is a premium high-tech disposable vape built for a dual mesh coil— giving you full control over vapour density and flavour intensity. It’s the most advanced Adalya disposable ever, delivering a true Turkish shisha-style experience in a compact all-in-one device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with an LED display, Ice\/Nic control, and adjustable wattage, this Adalya flavour vape reaches up to 40,000 puffs, delivering premium performance and flavor in a compact and modern design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Turkish Flavours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 40,000 puffs\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDigital LED display with power control\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjusting ICE and nicotine levels\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C charging port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiquid capacity: approx. 25 ml\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e850mAh rechargeable battery\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh coil for greater purity and flavor intensity\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGerman manufacturing with high quality standards\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IGET","offers":[{"title":"Blue melon","offer_id":42030462009399,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Blue Melon","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lady Killer","offer_id":42030465941559,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Lady Killer","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Love66","offer_id":42030465974327,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Love 66","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Punkman","offer_id":42030466039863,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Punkman","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":